  "raw_label": "1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Kamlesh Chotelal Vanvasi vs State Of Maharashtra Thr Pso., Ps ... on 25 February, 2026 2026:Bhc-Nag:3318 1 61- In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay, Nagpur Bench, Nagpur. Criminal Application (Aba) No. 80 Of 2026 Kamlesh Chotelal Vanvasi Vs. State of Maharashtra With Criminal Application (Aba) No. 82 Of 2026 Vinod Kumar S/o. Ram Bahadur Vs. State of Maharashtra And Criminal Application (Aba) No. 85 Of 2026 Kamal Mahesh Kumar Chotiya and another Vs. State of Maharashtra -------------------------------------------------------------------- Office Notes, Office Memoranda of Court' Coram, appearances, Court's Orders or directions and Registrar's order -------------------------------------------------------------------- Shri S. A. Mohta, Advocate for applicant.",
    "facts": "5. The prosecution case is that API- Vijaysingh Gomlaadu of Police Station Vedner, Dist. Wardha intercepted a Truck bearing registration No. GT-27-TD- 9916, which was being driven by the applicant in ABA No. 82/2026 and was assisted by the applicant in ABA No. 80/2026. During search of the Truck, contraband article- scented tobacco amounting approximately Rs.1,24,13,600/- was seized. The Truck was then taken to the Police Station, the Food Safety Officer was called and the First Information Report came to be registered. All the contraband scented tobacco found in the Truck was seized by the Police. However, the applicant in ABA No. 80/2026 and 82/2026 were allowed to go by the Police. 6. The entire contraband scented tobacco as well as the Truck have already been seized by the Police and nothing is required to be seized from the present applicants. In a case like this, seizure of the contraband RR Jaiswal 3 61-aba-80-82-85-26.odt articles is crucial part of the investigation, which is already complete. 7. The applicants were protected by ad-interim order of this Court dated 05.02.2026. Under the dictum of this Court, they have attended the concerned Police Station and co-operated in the investigation.",
